<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "After considering an application under section 9 and any additional document or information provided under section 10, the Registrar may approve or refuse the application."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@> .
