<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the application is approved, the Registrar shall register the applicant by entering the applicant’s particulars in the register of veterans referred to in section 8."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@> .
