<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection (1), and sections 9 and 10, any person who immediately before the coming into operation of this Act is registered as a veteran with the Jabatan Arah Rekod dan Pencen Markas Angkatan Tentera Malaysia shall, on the coming into operation of this Act, be deemed to be a veteran registered under this Act. Issuance of Veteran Card"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@> .
