<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@/~part_IV__cl_14__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Without prejudice to the generality of subsection (1), if the Registrar is satisfied that such association is a non-political organization for the advancement of the welfare of veterans and that the constitution of such association contains provisions for such matters as set out in the Schedule, the Registrar shall approve the registration of such association as a veterans association under this Act. Register of veterans association"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@> .
