<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the application for registration is approved by the Registrar, he shall register the association as a veteran association in the register of veterans associations to be kept and maintained by the Registrar in such manner and form as may be prescribed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@> .
