<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@/~part_IV__cl_17> <https://schema.org/text> "Any association registered under the Societies Act 1966 [Act 335] on the date of coming into operation of this Act shall cease to be registered under the Societies Act 1966 and shall within three months thereof apply to the Registrar to be registered under this Act as a veterans association to carry out any veteran activity; and such association shall continue to operate as an association until notified otherwise by the Registrar. Revocation or suspension of registration by Registrar"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/1/eng@> .
